#: inc/class-privacy.php:44
msgid "While WordSocket keeps a history of journeys, ShopSocket adds to each visit the shopping cart it was made with: the products it held, its value, and the order it became. It is kept with the journey, for as long as WordSocket keeps that, and exported and erased with it. Shoppers who were not logged in are known only by a random id their browser made, unless their browser remembers the email of an earlier order here, in which case staff see that email, flagged as a guess, for two days."
